GeoTech compatibility patch for htcr/sam_road @ 04b67c503f120ecff2b2dc5a2041ea6d300e306a
Applied by road_extraction/setup_sam_road.sh via 'git apply'. Keep minimal.
  - model.py: make 'wandb' import optional (training-only logging dependency).
  - model.py: load the SAM ViT-B checkpoint with map_location='cpu'.
  - inferencer.py: torch>=2.6 defaults torch.load(weights_only=True); Lightning
    checkpoints need weights_only=False.

